### GET request to example server
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "otunctan",
  "email": "otunctan@example.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "roles": ["USER"]
}

### POST Login request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "otunctan",
  "password": "123456"
}

